DATA LICENSING

Code in this repository is MIT-licensed. Underlying data sources are licensed
separately:

- US Government datasets (CDC PLACES, CDC SVI, CMS Medicare Disparities,
  CDC WONDER, US Census Bureau ACS, USDA Food Access Atlas, EPA EJScreen):
  Public domain (US Government works, 17 U.S.C. § 105).

- Map the Meal Gap (Feeding America): Free for research use; redistribution
  restricted. See feedingamerica.org/research/map-the-meal-gap.

- Eviction Lab data: Creative Commons (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).
  See evictionlab.org/methodology.

- Social Capital Atlas (Chetty et al.): Available via Humanitarian Data
  Exchange; check the Atlas terms of use.

No raw data files from these sources are redistributed in this repository.
See data/raw/ACQUISITION.md for download instructions.
